  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "王喬無病，狗頭不痛。亡跛失履，乏我徒從。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0423af227c635a022a48a6f3424f99a8b56e708ca0b2eb677e3eea26ebfd7f2b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9f1bf30bf14f8575d5cd8a5afc4bd0d561b55cbfd247c0b07663c7dd042beecf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "嗛囁噱嚶，昧冥相持。多言少實，語無成事。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:934a60cb0ca850350e25cbad0a62905967c6cbe9e02a7d8d8206094702a9ff05",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7e870484df9f8d391f9b4022bef61104a92d03d8d8b14302139cfa4c14d537e5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "北辰紫宮，衣冠立中。含和達德，常受大福。鉛刀攻玉，堅不可得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c5275cad818d0906981e0498181d0801fcb149c7e71480d60713f4defa032c21",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8900b9e8012ac3fbe24268a0621790dbe0f4dd605cc79b512acd397c2e66bf80"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "東壁餘光，數暗不明。王母嫉妒，亂我事業。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dca6d0e04c0a992ee680b1182b6d25cd02c49536205e14c2a06ead76b79cff2d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a56d37e5a52222b2ee32a419fc38910ca677058dddcf84a94497bcede4c0ae1a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "下背其上，資明其讓。子嬰兩頭，陳破其壚。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b8f121136dc2b47483cdd0df61d66787fbb9a0ffca97722e1cc25d50c5286adf",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:36c0a400e3fb6d1771c73563db782e7dd3e1aa3161b40d2b41f5cfa3ca16d4b1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "鳳生會稽，稍巨能飛。翱翔桂林，為眾鳥雄。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:740a7dfd54b08e810bab34690620f3e4e893183548951bf1895523ebec483f79",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:56ae883dac1fe254f0a484b58236a6098ab8a54958281f828396d0c5752d543d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "鑿井求玉，非和氏寶。名困身辱，勞無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4181220155ed7a64cc6b63e9d179e8c55682b7e68963936de9bf1a800118e1d9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:32110f95f34aad5059e02cadfa3b40a28da534e1e2279af749f1590960b3e6b6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "邦傑載復，送至東萊。百僚具舉，君王嘉喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ed2cc8dbeccd7cd73479e411b27d6eeed649795065c4d1a3a92db508b9ba688f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:88cd3928dc78180fc77883a0aac0bbbc11451c2f8b3b8a615052c60920f2c199"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "安息康居，異國穹廬。非吾邦域，使伯憂戚。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8a944931842c3d040d51995b1355818bc75e25fba6bfc6dfd7e78595903f4bd5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:95fb42efdee1d2db1ef10c16e18f9dd2ade5d59c2f645b824d8dc83be8261b21"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "江河淮海，天之都市。商人受福，國家富有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:058a8f675328bc6af6a8d1fee0be3b00a2f7eb4daf880a1028b9830126f4ed46",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b042aa1c384ad1ffb8d746204c93035ce2a1e3096ddc590687a983de86677750"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "同木異葉，樂仁尚德。東林慕義，來興吾國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8d8d735182d45eca8f3a2b9c7b0f18246c4edc902f1948c67b1a28b95aae0414",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:36f52da9b907673dc3f44e5593f24dd145697be9cab46d6f9525c704fb76010f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "白鶴御珠，夜室反明。懷我德音，身受光榮。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3333e871351e8ae47df06142cd2f32cf00d7914f17d89a4def74a0b2bba61e28",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b884b8eed3171c93e91f8618ee78015dbed0596dc402be0826ce8d1a3e6e2df9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "踐履危難，脫厄去患。入臨喜門，見吾母君。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2448de80edf7c833fb9c9cd08308e0ce5bd1200bde0e6c7911a09269620c5b0c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e9cfc5fcba48037294104e4bf69f6e1c130e2a726ae6a742e15dacc45221d2ea"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "宮商既和，聲音相隨。驪駒在門，主君以歡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:420a7a8ec62f68d42c9388f9d55da75692d49049e18ac4c793b446886470f7a6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a1999f89b9511182314489bd61b4d1dbc96772f23504082019be0f1f622dfb7f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "天地配享，六位光明。陰陽順序，以成厥功。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:09440f49cad38bb030ee509a204ca6fec57924ffdb9f27a962991659fceae820",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:617b9c004527b4bc8fb30a8b02e55df7b50e3ac7f62601404705dd4f0e995843"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "江河淮海，天之奧府。眾利所聚，可以饒有。樂我君子。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:45e18266da1f4e030135e2ad5a06494be7ab546c5113bacebe723af7d0bc37ae",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b9e2f88c5e5bd8c8912ccbaba032dedbd38d8455b9ebd9204fa36ba20fccb8b6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "雙鳥並飛，欲歸稻池。徑涉藿澤，為矢所射。傷我胸臆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:41a25fbc87548c31f2801c38ae0e0ad5bee0154177ed9d80403e7d2bcb78c7a0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e0c4e1919538b960f906705c7041ad6592aa4b9f7c756438bc6ff1ac2c264d3b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "伯仲叔季，日暮寢寐。裸臥失明，喪我貝囊。銜卸道傍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:039fa63a670de582bbfaf5b98ea98b6efa6b6f9c368451bbbc26938e58f561a3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8940796e53ef8f2aad5c2b325b1b1c9772d2d37fa0149bc0143cd9f016f9683e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "受終文祖，承衰復起。以義自閑，雖苦無咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:46714141600da86022111606351d684a01881f4a1ff32ea95321597687ae058e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f5ff7350fef68d8f446cef42eb32fc14323556107dfb89d9d80995f089a1154f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "旋斗運樞，順天無憂，與樂並俱。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:64f2314062a6d4d51861220e657a92367256bc952a758adde26d7a0db55f8b90",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ebe61d0e6357b5643dbc1ec3a6dae7349adf1dd74cbbd4101b82d0e9905220ca"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "周師伐紂，戰於牧野。甲子平旦，天下悅喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:85a4642f5364912b0e752614a06447838fee4c45cabd71b2dafbcc8c33c01cd6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f9939d46374bc116839fa8c6e7f9e4ea257cccc10c9dd26c7ea01a9d4345f142"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "十雌百雛，常與母俱。抱雞搏虎，誰敢害者。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:70df5035bad569ba242b569bd628806a939cd99684f5868eadb5dbc1aa972183",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f9f23dffe8d2729dce8568384e82c3b04616167572c5fba5d9c2592659b85fa7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "桀跖並處，人民愁苦。擁兵荷糧，戰於齊魯。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ae1430b1dee06f41da3231e5389be41fbe12826e655083377549c2ba30e24f73",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:86b54d601f03bde578c24640bcd4c3cefac36753f76a1abef7e088f3730f96a7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "南山昊天，刺政閔身。侯悲無辜，背憎為仇。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c6dff9c20a21fd6ec57802691057eadbfbd97cb1a3a150c8621a93d691e1ff4d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d02782794bb9f9d7b77942e4ef094a2f2d63457ce5dea95b29cdc22d43555699"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "百川朝海，流行不止。道雖遼遠，無不到者。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2d53544076d6ac5c167df0babb8257122bd9deef31c8f4c6ed6fa0f237782970",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:79bb2d34703f2410d7852abc3af7f3ef5ab88a6862c9dc03cb56e61cccd6652f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "目不可合，憂來搖足。悚惕危懼，去其邦域。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b4219b3e4a64c061a01f45da2b1d5025d913fb8331bb31d09e4e0d630a37067b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b220c6dc605adfbe03f96f2ca7e04fe6d2d0ff4833c38d815aa24aab7af735a7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "鳥升鵠舉，照臨東海。 降庭堅，為陶叔後。封於蓼丘，福履綏厚。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e70d6ce0a5f148390db72043043753946d0f4b25e7e89b698f4d40f4546453b9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c6fb7f0e5c606eb48fc008d1934c47e3568c7bb57825d05150fae3968a162c32"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "北方多棗，橘柚所聚。荷囊載香，盈我筐筥。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c275de85e90787dd31444acc2e61b6e1d0e229ba3091dd96dc1e9594679bdec7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:94343f2d2cbcd6f2a42beb7825cb38b64ce65d6876f962fc61412f86d0a8693d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "懸貆素餐，食非其任。失望遠民，實勞我心。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:78ec2078984eafdaf4c699a17b52ea29cfbf6eab74185179d60bc34468e4a5f4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fed9622b14859ff5d147de18bfbd960c9f123bd6140e896f7a4107305db667d1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "羔羊皮革，君子朝服。輔政扶德，以合萬國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cd30a194eb9381b4e2e0ffd394ac83d79773b589d9e6c70dd5c386c45ca07915",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:28d3c3e8832d3afaad1c033889e8fb41566895fbea05f56de36048f618b4d412"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "齊魯爭言，戰於龍門。搆怨致禍，三歲不安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a4a1116e1f0b1d490af200b286a44cdabe1a078fcc06a4b4aba359659ac0b778",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:74f67d345b2ee51b1d8b208fa0f3811aafff5a51e9b98df0b5e7fc4c28b10704"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "久陰霖雨，塗行泥潦。商人休止，市空無有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a87b4b51ea251ce169c346bf97c795fa866dc91596753f5cb64aaacd46c4dd09",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a3fc2fb85ba86e271a47ecd4fb5bba34a34f65f6cd9f7700eceaeaaf5b70f513"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "桃鵠竊脂，來於小枝。搖動不安，為風所吹。寒心悚慄，常憂殆危。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:956c400edf22e72aea850f258ab9b1c953a031037f7215145cad970aec43bfda",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:aed5c4718102071034886ced8ad2084e00538c5d0420fa92c10b257d444256a2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "防患備災，凶禍不來，雖困無災。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3a7f65a8ec7329f3896ace0a40d5c4d65e2d65a2a62c07ab49b0a097ccf0d869",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5b1e27fcd2a5fdf02e95c48c2fa652ec5c9cfdcf81b6877467057b1f2078e274"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "引頸絕糧，與母異門。不見所懽，孰與共言。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8a1ba29310cb207e6893f0477227444af2b7ea26ba90b7a2a52ec0c3afc2fcc1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4fd4acea679f156641ec5beae51d97132d194bb5a05bd6fbc223f7f9cf7e9e72"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "蝦去海，藏於枯里。街巷偏隘，不得自在。南北無極，渴餒成疾。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:13cade08abf683e7759bc6e2e6b346dca42f85acc9b41d2996028f1bdd616129",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6400789d5b2bdbc876e8af0a4decbef9a2b6f8f1918aa1af0c8754695d286e4e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "恭寬信敏，功加四海。辟去不祥，喜來從母。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e240f338673e1c6c0f1a9369fd57c7cf81cbb74b702813156c6a92bca204cce7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cfafa01d575df99986efdaa530227f89375b20fc8a7982e73e4c2266fe1b5545"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "歲饑無年，虐政害民。乾溪驪山，秦楚結怨。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0061d5feb2fe2433af01f1a2b715dcd2d7c7d9207f37e0e8da937fe5565ba63f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a4429f07176bb368813d769c089a99c33ff2038822410a88053c43c3cb663f1a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "右目無瞳，偏視寡明。十步之內，不知何公。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:35195e7fd1cbf9a780695cc75ab91c84fb5c53be80a421afcc88a40bdb0dc644",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3709829586026c254af3b541b948d067c38fd50f89924c88fccf97060c7a7347"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "蜩螗歡喜，草木嘉茂。百果蕃熾，日益庶有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b1e376370c27e47cb044789e7e512ff5737e4cb50504dcf1ec4959cca3c69302",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2c56db887b49824ddd58c8c6c613f2df9a0f64ff9f348753feb8267a5918b3ba"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "常德自如，安坐無尤。幸入貴鄉，到老安榮。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8a7ef6e35ea5cba4b20cc0f735e52e5a46e566d2e8666376b3325b8354ee68db",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:697fbd62ac3b20a7a3aa9732e472296465a92e6031b88174405a6a1ff136230b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "狡兔趯趯，犬良逐咋。雄雉受害，為鷹所獲。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8832d347d555b225d2a0a4c1e9146c8a9c065ef18a736aad704850b692473dba",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d81df49dc001a28b91c748c4dffe64004af075f7bf9a07c35dd3fda572a2466a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "春桃生花，季女宜家。受福多年，男為封君。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a9da46c1d753822050ff935517d07cc4fb64396f73e3fee805e2a6571e4c6e42",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2ad54de950f276d5fe9acc88759d2931e78d38d70d2262f639da2afda8a04135"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "山石朽弊，消崩墜落。上下離心，君失其崇。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2252408d77f3b8622ac0b2d6b835c1fdf4ad9c7c829a73b272f06bdc122d09b1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9d4ff4dca60ea40bf1804416cdd412576dbdf924f2e79b9cc85f103a2312dcb1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "水壞我里，東流為海。龜鳧讙譁，不睹我家。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b91bdd523038d1a84907986695ee92b7a714e2d9c25a07fb5e46a9d8cdedde0f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0745a39e87c05751dd88c3f2337093fd7af0ce4abe2e1cd079fc70c1f1f7149b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "十竅龍身，造化八元。法天則地，順時施行。富貴長存。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4680786450baea8e3b92d47b18d5f709eb196b79e225165387f5962b6dd6e3f3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:68db7a0eee8cef69ee111636f4bd5ac96a6a6778b9cf5f40274a3fbb327d2785"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "四夷慕德，來興我國。文君降陟，合受其德。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e407b67c79ed38985b5c9e81543bacf3d3fa481c522f00d3b21503dc8ff65dd6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b221d8f5fb27072a960b94d1a67ca9430319e15e90f0871ec1e12c6b57868680"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "華首山頭，仙道所遊。利以居止，長無咎憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1dbf17fc303f68f917fa05e64da8fecd9b9270d9bed2c0d32adbe7968cd3ca0c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9a06eb57f759f9862cc8453a8c80d69d25a0e2bcbc6d5553ff199c62d01f7145"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "鸇鳩徙來，西至平州。遭逢雷雹，損我葦蘆。家室飢寒，思吾故初。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:60fe5df4ad1f4420f4d4666387a675fda46ac78c5de0696aacefd3ed8ab8306a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:be41a5b712e0aff2f64987599b6a350275fc698dbfa0760608b4a7bf544dfbf9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "狗無前足，陰雄叛北，為身害賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bae9f9535aba7394d1d4b8bae5c86ebd1f4b24145e87db1c98f3ae5de71ce9f8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:eebad553c11439f4a77071c9c339906b1e6e965758d8e7d2fd53acd517bff805"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "陽孤亢極，多所恨惑。車傾蓋亡，身常驚惶。乃得其願，雌雄相存。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:770f529372c4dd5f75d00bb44abf6249901f46b1d7cd2ccd3ac3732d15d46c3d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1ac3d1014d3cf87dd203fc6796737881e008f0b88f721108fa1aa6177dc66c46"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "空槽住豬，豚彘不至。張弓祝雞，雄父飛去。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:807c00598c8e96f43b87d8b5f373f050519dd3027e2c86a926bb82104f411776",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:060eacbf7cb92a546c4a9cc9bc5bf194e8a1c360d5eec7add326157ff3cf5903"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "長夜短日，陰為陽賊。萬物空枯，藏於北陸。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:14de5d9c828880e69f1418d825a3e79f735ab647a2efed20f143e393cabb0811",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8cdf8c2e7f16a50dd51d253b16580294f69077d952dfaad81690f1413138c46a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "爪牙之士，怨毒祈父。轉憂於己，傷不及母。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:02ba284493acb0639c91cdd7675e38f49ba2ce2bbf6324d7aeab05ff4ae5b3d9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a5002e142bc288175ff4ef0d0502257507dbe2906a9e4eb8a0fd8d1b387982a5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "拜跪請兔，不得臭腐。俯首御指，不得北去。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4c59488324fdee93f212b4e39262559e88867fd9cb154b97347feaa141b4cdeb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5d8c5efed6ee81a058223035be78246be79cc538a19efae71a80c7f5bc2ca827"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "有莘季女，為王妃后。貴夫壽子，母字四海。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ca1728bd2a5cae795d0686a57ab6d71cfc92c163228fb6bec123c1b145a01a56",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:143350d39820cc168a883231cf0661733e3325191389dfeb3a4f8892ebb60be4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "季姜躊躕，待孟城隅。終日至旦，不見齊侯。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fbe54991c1f890c271c02809a2626968afaed070bdd78d9e9cb9f6ce7efb5b29",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e35175dbdbe06792e1c28e5929723f6b37622ef58098dc0fa599fdefbb6f7cbb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "邯鄲反言，父兄生患。涉此憂恨，卒死不還。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7082f9c900d83aa1b549881c61a84f5cc2f67fa1ef633aa681047a707dfb0755",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:821bae41b0a9024f5ae4e32388492be3c66425b67cf249ce14c81f7a7ba361ad"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "逐鹿山巔，利去我西。維邪南北，所求不得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dd6519b1663e4e249acc9e5f5ef55ff5f2c9153d50b841d2a3dc1943a8f5e21d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ebdee5b47445b84a8a3b89357abe6b1258a490835d8c4c04c8b10a8db9958943"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "穿鼻繫珠，為虎所拘。王母祝福，禍不成災。突然自來。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bf438d5d27fe3750c5a408d0cc885e907f0ef7de49a5209064c5f94c67684849",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a55f71fe842b1534e96be6c79c192743fefc2dfb005af2bef5f6e0caed1eb333"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "虎豹熊羆，遊戲山谷。君子仁賢，亦得所欲。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a06682f383f05408922a1329757809e5443d8b8b6b2ff0a2dedc560f10da01db",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:13db29acb6aa9948fcd2213a7c05bc6e64654db2155abb862c50d0d7b074edf1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "梅李冬實，國多盜賊。擾亂並作，王不得制。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:20be73c1edcdbd0627d2abba4e341f0557f34c3cf56b96b6f7c02cabc63d8f8b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:07d82e12ba6d5fa04617a2e7b6cd540703f46d7d3ca3668c2752cbe6863ce62e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "望幸不到，文章未就。羊子逐兔，犬踦不得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d597c2dfc45c6213a3b4322cf5ee373a281ed73b27b10eee8c50ba46b2f32079",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:03e8f1bddaba368167c7a493b1c73f4964f0e64d7f003d754a78e908d2d43f62"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 15,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "千柱百梁，終不傾僵。仁智輔聖，周宗寧康。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:378f9e2340184d7199385f7295fcf81fa489ce8cbe48ff102cbeb831411c2334",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:67e7eafdd032f3c8786992fa870d0312f06206bee63c0c0f6fc2f7052dd4327c"
    }
  ]
}
